(7268647, 1130596, 61396, '<td valign="top">maybe not organic, but still beautiful.</td>', 'maybe not organic, but still beautiful.', '2014-10-02 16:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7268649, 1130524, 61396, '<td valign="top">well caught. interesting processing.</td>', 'well caught. interesting processing.', '2014-10-02 16:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7268650, 1130524, 150277, '<td valign="top">At first glance I wasn''t sure I liked this image much, but as I sat with the image it really grew on me.  The processing really works for me.  I really liked the color and texture of the water, and the tangle of branches made for a pleasing, yet defined, composition.  <br/> <br/>I am little less sure about how well this image met my original interpretation of the challenge of ''find a subject'' that shows organic geometry.  The sticks seem like multiple subjects, and I''m not sure how much geometry I see in the water.<br/> <br/>But overall I still really like the image and I think it''s a creative twist on the challenge.</td>', 'At first glance I wasn''t sure I liked this image much, but as I sat with the image it really grew on me.  The processing really works for me.  I really liked the color and texture of the water, and the tangle of branches made for a pleasing, yet defined, composition.   I am little less sure about how well this image met my original interpretation of the challenge of ''find a subject'' that shows organic geometry.  The sticks seem like multiple subjects, and I''m not sure how much geometry I see in the water. But overall I still really like the image and I think it''s a creative twist on the challenge.', '2014-10-02 16:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7268652, 1130595, 150277, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, and you captured some really interesting geometry, but I found the yellows a little harsh and the spot on the right side that looks a little brownish distracted me a bit.</td>', 'I like the concept, and you captured some really interesting geometry, but I found the yellows a little harsh and the spot on the right side that looks a little brownish distracted me a bit.', '2014-10-02 16:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7268654, 1130544, 150277, '<td valign="top">I really enjoyed this.  I love the dark colors, and placement of your subject in the frame.  This really feels like a special shot to me.</td>', 'I really enjoyed this.  I love the dark colors, and placement of your subject in the frame.  This really feels like a special shot to me.', '2014-10-02 16:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7268655, 1130132, 150277, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting on the mushroom.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting on the mushroom.', '2014-10-02 16:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7268657, 1130139, 150277, '<td valign="top">Definitely interesting geometry, and I like the lighting and capture.</td>', 'Definitely interesting geometry, and I like the lighting and capture.', '2014-10-02 16:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7268658, 1130137, 150277, '<td valign="top">I like the silhouette idea for this shot, makes the geometry really stand out.  There is a bit of blurriness on the left and right sides in the center that distracted me a bit.  I kept trying to decide if it was just windy or if this was an effect you planned/wanted.  (But the blur took away a bit from my enjoyment of this image.)</td>', 'I like the silhouette idea for this shot, makes the geometry really stand out.  There is a bit of blurriness on the left and right sides in the center that distracted me a bit.  I kept trying to decide if it was just windy or if this was an effect you planned/wanted.  (But the blur took away a bit from my enjoyment of this image.)', '2014-10-02 16:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7268659, 1130604, 150277, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors and geometry.  That very left tip of the plant seems out of focus, but since there is where the image led my eye it was a bit of a letdown for that tip not to be sharp.  But overall I still really enjoyed this photo.</td>', 'Lovely colors and geometry.  That very left tip of the plant seems out of focus, but since there is where the image led my eye it was a bit of a letdown for that tip not to be sharp.  But overall I still really enjoyed this photo.', '2014-10-02 16:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
