(7268746, 1130546, 119419, '<td valign="top">My top pick. It has a beauty and essence of creation (not in a religious sense), an emerging theme, a realisation.</td>', 'My top pick. It has a beauty and essence of creation (not in a religious sense), an emerging theme, a realisation.', '2014-10-02 22:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7268748, 1130356, 119419, '<td valign="top">Another of my top picks. Simplicity, yet the duality of a primitive but advanced biological and metaphysical statement executed with artistic subtlety.</td>', 'Another of my top picks. Simplicity, yet the duality of a primitive but advanced biological and metaphysical statement executed with artistic subtlety.', '2014-10-02 22:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7268749, 1130596, 119419, '<td valign="top">Another top pick, primal and evocative yet evokes a feelings of advanced communicative intelligence. And I like the story it tells even if I don''t what that story is, perhaps because it makes me feel part of something greater than the sum of ''us''.</td>', 'Another top pick, primal and evocative yet evokes a feelings of advanced communicative intelligence. And I like the story it tells even if I don''t what that story is, perhaps because it makes me feel part of something greater than the sum of ''us''.', '2014-10-02 22:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7268753, 1130572, 119419, '<td valign="top">I always imagined she was old(ish), Eddie always gave that impression. Lovely example of the challenge brief.</td>', 'I always imagined she was old(ish), Eddie always gave that impression. Lovely example of the challenge brief.', '2014-10-02 22:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7268754, 1130220, 119419, '<td valign="top">The sound of one cactus clapping falling in the desert, a very crowded solitude and worth the listen.</td>', 'The sound of one cactus clapping falling in the desert, a very crowded solitude and worth the listen.', '2014-10-02 22:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7268755, 1130132, 119419, '<td valign="top">Gets my beauty award, probably a top placement. Always appreciate anthropomorphic Basidiomycetes (?) organisms coupled with artistic macro techniques.</td>', 'Gets my beauty award, probably a top placement. Always appreciate anthropomorphic Basidiomycetes (?) organisms coupled with artistic macro techniques.', '2014-10-02 22:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7268763, 1130546, 50695, '<td valign="top">when I look at this picture, Organic Geometry is not one of the first things that comes to mind, thank goodness.<br/> <br/>What are the words that come to your mind? Be honest. <br/> <br/>It''s only fair I take my own challenge. Let''s see...<br/> <br/>Flying Nun caught in a spoon<br/> <br/>mother being cold to her son, who sits facing away from her as his face disappears<br/> <br/>cat robots taking over the world and making it fly<br/> <br/>Modernist bats mocking Surrealism<br/> <br/>armpit stain that looks like Jesus<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1077279" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg"/></a></td>', 'when I look at this picture, Organic Geometry is not one of the first things that comes to mind, thank goodness. What are the words that come to your mind? Be honest.  It''s only fair I take my own challenge. Let''s see... Flying Nun caught in a spoon mother being cold to her son, who sits facing away from her as his face disappears cat robots taking over the world and making it fly Modernist bats mocking Surrealism armpit stain that looks like Jesus ', '2014-10-02 22:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7268764, 1130502, 50695, '<td valign="top">The organic sea cut up into geometry.<br/> <br/>The organic woman surrounded by geometry, staring into geometry.<br/> <br/>Woman at the window, like the one Dali painted.<br/> <br/>This photo has that empty quality, that waiting quality ...<br/> <br/>I''m hanging it in my fantasy art gallery<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1077279" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg"/></a></td>', 'The organic sea cut up into geometry. The organic woman surrounded by geometry, staring into geometry. Woman at the window, like the one Dali painted. This photo has that empty quality, that waiting quality ... I''m hanging it in my fantasy art gallery ', '2014-10-02 22:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
