(7268811, 1130301, 54446, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tanguera:</b></div><hr/><i> A view like this can only be a Hahn. While beautiful, I am not seeing the geometry in this. One could argue that the geometry is everywhere, in everything.  But that is the problem with themed challenges.  I think voters, for better or worse, respond better to specifity </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Specifically, the geometry is angle of repose.  Sorry you didn''t comprehend.</td>', 'Originally posted by tanguera: A view like this can only be a Hahn. While beautiful, I am not seeing the geometry in this. One could argue that the geometry is everywhere, in everything.  But that is the problem with themed challenges.  I think voters, for better or worse, respond better to specifity  Specifically, the geometry is angle of repose.  Sorry you didn''t comprehend.', '2014-10-03 01:05:32.000000', NULL, 0),
