(7269298, 1130132, 37858, '<td valign="top">This was my highest-rated image in this challenge.  It''s nice to see so many others agreed with me.  I love everything about the image, but especially like the diagonal line of foliage caused by your choice of lens, focus, and aperture when establishing your depth of field.  The lighting, composition, and bokeh are all icing on the cake.  Well done.</td>', 'This was my highest-rated image in this challenge.  It''s nice to see so many others agreed with me.  I love everything about the image, but especially like the diagonal line of foliage caused by your choice of lens, focus, and aperture when establishing your depth of field.  The lighting, composition, and bokeh are all icing on the cake.  Well done.', '2014-10-04 14:25:31.000000', NULL, 0),
